+# Third-party register
+
+Every external origin the app loads from or sends data to. Adding one requires an
+entry here, a matching update to the CSP in `src/middleware.ts`, and a mention in
+the privacy policy (`src/pages/legal/privacy.astro`).
+
+| Service | Origin | Data shared | Basis | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Google Fonts | fonts.googleapis.com, fonts.gstatic.com | IP, user agent | Legitimate interest (display) | Consider self-hosting to remove entirely. |
+| Analytics client | us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net | IP, page views, interactions | Consent (opt-in) | Loaded only after consent; blocked under DNT/GPC. |
+| Account API | us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net/times_cdn/api | Username, password | Contract (sign in/up) | Called only on form submit; credentials are never stored locally. |
+| Teaser image | cinemai-1026410574114.us-central1.run.app | IP, user agent | Legitimate interest | Consider copying the image locally. |
+| Ad network | (disabled) | n/a | n/a | Script is commented out in `Layout.astro`; re-enabling requires consent gating. |
+
+## Audit process
+
+- Review this register and the CSP at least once a year and whenever a dependency or integration changes.
+- Run `pnpm audit` regularly and before releases.
+- Confirm each vendor’s data-processing terms and that no data beyond the table above is shared.
+- Remove entries that are no longer used.
